  <text>
    <body>
      <p><seg source="#source-259-303">一、地にひれふしてあめつちに</seg></p>
      <p style="text-indent: 2em" rend="first-line-indent(2)"><seg source="#source-303-347">いのりしまこといれられず</seg></p>
      <p style="text-indent: 2em" rend="first-line-indent(2)"><seg source="#source-347-388">日出づる國のくにたみは</seg></p>
      <p style="text-indent: 2em" rend="first-line-indent(2)"><seg source="#source-388-434">あやめもわかぬやみぢゆく</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-434-440">二、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-440-473"><rb>御大喪</rb><rt>オホミハフリ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-473-493">の今日の日に</seg></p>
      <p style="text-indent: 2em" rend="first-line-indent(2)"><seg source="#source-493-528">流るゝ涙はてもなし</seg></p>
      <p style="text-indent: 2em" rend="first-line-indent(2)"><seg source="#source-528-569">きさらぎの空はるあさみ</seg></p>
      <p style="text-indent: 2em" rend="first-line-indent(2)"><seg source="#source-569-605">寒風いとゞ身にはしむ</seg></p>
    </body>
